    "body": "resolves #39648\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in #39648, current parser in `runtime/lua/vim/net/_ssh.lua` relies on manual string manipulation, which can be fragile. Also, as mentioned in [this comment](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39648#issuecomment-5380513278), current parser does not handle host names separated by `,` correctly.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nI wrote a new minimal parser using LPeg, which replaces the old one and makes the parser easier to understand and modify. I also fixed the current behavior of the parser such that it returns host names correctly.",
